{"id":"087811585401a368","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-L2-model.md","title":"Two-Sorted Structures and Satisfaction","display":"df-L2-model — Two-Sorted Structures and Satisfaction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-L2-model","aliases":["62-df-L2-model"],"display":"df-L2-model — Two-Sorted Structures and Satisfaction","depends_on":["[[62-df-L2]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definitions I.2.2–I.2.3; Definition II.8.3 (distinction)","source_pages":[3,4,92],"source_pdf_pages":[21,22,110]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-L2-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-L2-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-L2-model — Two-Sorted Structures and Satisfaction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definitions I.2.2–I.2.3; Definition II.8.3 (distinction)"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>3</span><span>4</span><span>92</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>21</span><span>22</span><span>110</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>语法见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=(M,\\mathcal S,+_M,\\cdot_M,0_M,1_M,&lt;_M)\">\\(\\mathcal M=(M,\\mathcal S,+_M,\\cdot_M,0_M,1_M,&lt;_M)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(M\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(M)\">\\(\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(M)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_M,\\cdot_M:M^2\\to M\">\\(+_M,\\cdot_M:M^2\\to M\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_M,1_M\\in M\">\\(0_M,1_M\\in M\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_M\\subseteq M^2\">\\(&lt;_M\\subseteq M^2\\)</span>。两种域加不同类型标签，以下略去标签。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=(g_N,g_S)\">\\(g=(g_N,g_S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_N:V_N\\to M\">\\(g_N:V_N\\to M\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_S:V_S\\to\\mathcal S\">\\(g_S:V_S\\to\\mathcal S\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>满足关系、赋值和项解释均在元理论中按有限语法树递归；不主张对象理论中存在全体公式的真值集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\">\\(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\)</span>，在元层取相应经典真值运算。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g[n\\mapsto a]\">\\(g[n\\mapsto a]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g[X\\mapsto A]\">\\(g[X\\mapsto A]\\)</span> 使用 Assertion 中的同类型赋值更新。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}L2\\text{-}model}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n⟦ n_i⟧_g&amp;=g_N(n_i),\\quad⟦0⟧_g=0_M,\\quad⟦1⟧_g=1_M,\\\\\n⟦ s+t⟧_g&amp;=⟦ s⟧_g+_M⟦ t⟧_g,\\quad\n⟦ s\\cdot t⟧_g=⟦ s⟧_g\\cdot_M⟦ t⟧_g,\\\\\n\\mathcal M,g\\models s=t&amp;\\leftrightarrow⟦ s⟧_g=⟦ t⟧_g,\\\\\n\\mathcal M,g\\models s&lt;t&amp;\\leftrightarrow⟦ s⟧_g&lt;_M⟦ t⟧_g,\\\\\n\\mathcal M,g\\models t\\in X&amp;\\leftrightarrow⟦ t⟧_g\\in g_S(X),\\\\\n\\mathcal M,g\\models\\neg\\alpha&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\neg(\\mathcal M,g\\models\\alpha),\\\\\n\\mathcal M,g\\models\\alpha\\circ\\beta&amp;\\leftrightarrow(\\mathcal M,g\\models\\alpha)\\circ(\\mathcal M,g\\models\\beta),\\\\\n\\mathcal M,g\\models\\forall n\\alpha&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\forall a\\in M\\;(\\mathcal M,g[n\\mapsto a]\\models\\alpha),\\\\\n\\mathcal M,g\\models\\exists n\\alpha&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists a\\in M\\;(\\mathcal M,g[n\\mapsto a]\\models\\alpha),\\\\\n\\mathcal M,g\\models\\forall X\\alpha&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\forall A\\in\\mathcal S\\;(\\mathcal M,g[X\\mapsto A]\\models\\alpha),\\\\\n\\mathcal M,g\\models\\exists X\\alpha&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists A\\in\\mathcal S\\;(\\mathcal M,g[X\\mapsto A]\\models\\alpha).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}L2\\text{-}model}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n⟦ n_i⟧_g&amp;=g_N(n_i),\\quad⟦0⟧_g=0_M,\\quad⟦1⟧_g=1_M,\\\\\n⟦ s+t⟧_g&amp;=⟦ s⟧_g+_M⟦ t⟧_g,\\quad\n⟦ s\\cdot t⟧_g=⟦ s⟧_g\\cdot_M⟦ t⟧_g,\\\\\n\\mathcal M,g\\models s=t&amp;\\leftrightarrow⟦ s⟧_g=⟦ t⟧_g,\\\\\n\\mathcal M,g\\models s&lt;t&amp;\\leftrightarrow⟦ s⟧_g&lt;_M⟦ t⟧_g,\\\\\n\\mathcal M,g\\models t\\in X&amp;\\leftrightarrow⟦ t⟧_g\\in g_S(X),\\\\\n\\mathcal M,g\\models\\neg\\alpha&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\neg(\\mathcal M,g\\models\\alpha),\\\\\n\\mathcal M,g\\models\\alpha\\circ\\beta&amp;\\leftrightarrow(\\mathcal M,g\\models\\alpha)\\circ(\\mathcal M,g\\models\\beta),\\\\\n\\mathcal M,g\\models\\forall n\\alpha&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\forall a\\in M\\;(\\mathcal M,g[n\\mapsto a]\\models\\alpha),\\\\\n\\mathcal M,g\\models\\exists n\\alpha&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists a\\in M\\;(\\mathcal M,g[n\\mapsto a]\\models\\alpha),\\\\\n\\mathcal M,g\\models\\forall X\\alpha&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\forall A\\in\\mathcal S\\;(\\mathcal M,g[X\\mapsto A]\\models\\alpha),\\\\\n\\mathcal M,g\\models\\exists X\\alpha&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists A\\in\\mathcal S\\;(\\mathcal M,g[X\\mapsto A]\\models\\alpha).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\\models T\\;:\\!\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in T\\;\\forall g\\;(\\mathcal M,g\\models\\sigma),\\qquad T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_2}^{2}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M\\models T\\;:\\!\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in T\\;\\forall g\\;(\\mathcal M,g\\models\\sigma),\\qquad T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_2}^{2}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n(g_N[n\\mapsto a])(m)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}a&amp;m=n,\\\\g_N(m)&amp;m\\ne n,\\end{cases}\\quad(m,n\\in V_N,\\ a\\in M),\\\\\n(g_S[X\\mapsto A])(Y)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}A&amp;Y=X,\\\\g_S(Y)&amp;Y\\ne X,\\end{cases}\\quad(X,Y\\in V_S,\\ A\\in\\mathcal S),\\\\\ng[n\\mapsto a]&amp;\\coloneqq(g_N[n\\mapsto a],g_S),\\quad\ng[X\\mapsto A]\\coloneqq(g_N,g_S[X\\mapsto A]).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n(g_N[n\\mapsto a])(m)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}a&amp;m=n,\\\\g_N(m)&amp;m\\ne n,\\end{cases}\\quad(m,n\\in V_N,\\ a\\in M),\\\\\n(g_S[X\\mapsto A])(Y)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}A&amp;Y=X,\\\\g_S(Y)&amp;Y\\ne X,\\end{cases}\\quad(X,Y\\in V_S,\\ A\\in\\mathcal S),\\\\\ng[n\\mapsto a]&amp;\\coloneqq(g_N[n\\mapsto a],g_S),\\quad\ng[X\\mapsto A]\\coloneqq(g_N,g_S[X\\mapsto A]).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\">\\(\\circ\\)</span> 在两侧分别表示语法联结词与其经典真值运算。递归沿有限项和公式树进行。集合量词的域是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal S\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S=\\mathcal P(M)\">\\(\\mathcal S=\\mathcal P(M)\\)</span> 是一种特例。用带类型域落实书中的域不交约定，并不要求略去标签后的自然数集合与它的子集族字面不交。满足关系在元理论中定义，未声称在 RCA₀ 中存在全部公式的真值集合。</p>\n<p>II.8.3 的可数一阶模型则是数集代码，明确给出闭项值和全部命名句子的真值函数；一般编码结构不能自动升级成该模型。IV.3 的“有一个可数模型”使用这个包含真值图的定义。本文件的元层递归既不为任意编码结构提供内部真值集，也不直接见证 II.8 或 IV.3 的模型存在结论。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Definitions I.2.2–I.2.3；纸面页 3、4、92；PDF 页 21、22、110（II.8.3 用于模型代码对照）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-L2]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"语法见 [[62-df-L2]]。$\\mathcal M=(M,\\mathcal S,+_M,\\cdot_M,0_M,1_M,<_M)$，$M\\ne\\varnothing$，$\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(M)$，$+_M,\\cdot_M:M^2\\to M$，$0_M,1_M\\in M$，$<_M\\subseteq M^2$。两种域加不同类型标签，以下略去标签。$g=(g_N,g_S)$，$g_N:V_N\\to M$，$g_S:V_S\\to\\mathcal S$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal M=(M,\\mathcal S,+_M,\\cdot_M,0_M,1_M,<_M)","display":false},{"tex":"M\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(M)","display":false},{"tex":"+_M,\\cdot_M:M^2\\to M","display":false},{"tex":"0_M,1_M\\in M","display":false},{"tex":"<_M\\subseteq M^2","display":false},{"tex":"g=(g_N,g_S)","display":false},{"tex":"g_N:V_N\\to M","display":false},{"tex":"g_S:V_S\\to\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}","display":false},{"tex":"g[n\\mapsto a]","display":false},{"tex":"g[X\\mapsto A]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}L2\\text{-}model}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n⟦ n_i⟧_g&=g_N(n_i),\\quad⟦0⟧_g=0_M,\\quad⟦1⟧_g=1_M,\\\\\n⟦ s+t⟧_g&=⟦ s⟧_g+_M⟦ t⟧_g,\\quad\n⟦ s\\cdot t⟧_g=⟦ s⟧_g\\cdot_M⟦ t⟧_g,\\\\\n\\mathcal M,g\\models s=t&\\leftrightarrow⟦ s⟧_g=⟦ t⟧_g,\\\\\n\\mathcal M,g\\models s<t&\\leftrightarrow⟦ s⟧_g<_M⟦ t⟧_g,\\\\\n\\mathcal M,g\\models t\\in X&\\leftrightarrow⟦ t⟧_g\\in g_S(X),\\\\\n\\mathcal M,g\\models\\neg\\alpha&\\leftrightarrow\\neg(\\mathcal M,g\\models\\alpha),\\\\\n\\mathcal M,g\\models\\alpha\\circ\\beta&\\leftrightarrow(\\mathcal M,g\\models\\alpha)\\circ(\\mathcal M,g\\models\\beta),\\\\\n\\mathcal M,g\\models\\forall n\\alpha&\\leftrightarrow\\forall a\\in M\\;(\\mathcal M,g[n\\mapsto a]\\models\\alpha),\\\\\n\\mathcal M,g\\models\\exists n\\alpha&\\leftrightarrow\\exists a\\in M\\;(\\mathcal M,g[n\\mapsto a]\\models\\alpha),\\\\\n\\mathcal M,g\\models\\forall X\\alpha&\\leftrightarrow\\forall A\\in\\mathcal S\\;(\\mathcal M,g[X\\mapsto A]\\models\\alpha),\\\\\n\\mathcal M,g\\models\\exists X\\alpha&\\leftrightarrow\\exists A\\in\\mathcal S\\;(\\mathcal M,g[X\\mapsto A]\\models\\alpha).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal M\\models T\\;:\\!\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in T\\;\\forall g\\;(\\mathcal M,g\\models\\sigma),\\qquad T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_2}^{2}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n(g_N[n\\mapsto a])(m)&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}a&m=n,\\\\g_N(m)&m\\ne n,\\end{cases}\\quad(m,n\\in V_N,\\ a\\in M),\\\\\n(g_S[X\\mapsto A])(Y)&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}A&Y=X,\\\\g_S(Y)&Y\\ne X,\\end{cases}\\quad(X,Y\\in V_S,\\ A\\in\\mathcal S),\\\\\ng[n\\mapsto a]&\\coloneqq(g_N[n\\mapsto a],g_S),\\quad\ng[X\\mapsto A]\\coloneqq(g_N,g_S[X\\mapsto A]).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\circ","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S=\\mathcal P(M)","display":false}],"bytes":3642,"backlinks":[{"id":"60af01126d249179","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)$，$\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal S}$ 为 [[62-df-omega-model]] 中的候选元组；$\\mathcal S\\ne\\varnothing$ 时才是其 ω 结构。满足关系采用 [[62-df-L2-model]] 的元层递归；$\\Sigma^1_1(S_2)$ 见 [[62-df-AnalyticHierarchy]]；赋值的变量域见 [[62-df-L2]]。Assertion 的非空分支中 $g_N:V_N\\to\\mathbb N$、$g_S:V_S\\to\\mathcal S$。"},{"id":"5ed7a378ff9d39c6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"双类结构满足关系见 [[62-df-L2-model]]，句子见 [[62-df-L2]]。$\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)$，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_2}^{2}$；数结构 $(\\mathbb N,+,\\cdot,0,1,<)$ 均为标准结构。"},{"id":"c68a6ecbed6addff","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[62-df-L2-model|Two-Sorted Structures and Satisfaction]]"},{"id":"c1326cfeaba0f163","anchor":"ref-51","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[62-df-L2-model]]"},{"id":"271bc9074a256041","anchor":"ref-206","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[62-df-L2-model]]"}],"outgoing":["4c6d2d9f1999915f"]}